  "standing": "Exact product bytes for NSS-F1's binding (X-NSS-B): each candidate is copied to its product path. The binding also re-pins the handshake SourcePin in crates/identity/src/schema_registry.rs, the currentAuthority of crates/components/tests/data/native-rust3-profile-cases.v1.json and that fixture's two digest constants in rust3/replay_tests.rs, which this map does not fix. The new schema is admission-registered only: its Rust embedding, identity source pin and generated carriers, the regenerated outputs and the native-carriers-v1 records belong to later units. Independent review and root assent are required before selection.",
